      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the bar counter, Denis confides in Kostya that he and Katya have broken up over a secret he cannot tell her. When Nastya demands to know what happened, Kostya panics and makes up a sympathetic story about a daughter in Voronezh.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
